    "tier": 2,
    "factionId": "",
    "notes": "<p>A giant raven the size of a lion, feathers scorched black with embers still clinging to wing and tail, a beak of jagged volcanic rock. The embodiment of avarice on the wing: it mesmerizes victims with visions of treasure, holding them captivated while it swoops in to take their valuables and their life force, in that order of preference.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Harab Serapel, the Ravens of Burning — the Hull of Netzach. Victory hollowed into rapacious greed.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'It will show you exactly what you want. That is not generosity. That is aiming.'</em></p>",
